#: admin/settings.php:1786
msgid "Automate form availability by configuring exact start and end dates/times (ideal for limited-time offers, events, and job postings) or capping maximum lead capacity (e.g. first 100 entries). Automatically closes the form and displays a customized friendly notice."
msgstr "Automate form availability by configuring exact start and end dates/times (ideal for limited-time offers, events, and job postings) or capping maximum lead capacity (e.g. first 100 entries). Automatically closes the form and displays a customized friendly notice."

